# Git / GitHub

- `main` is the integration branch.
- Use Requirement IDs in issue/branch/commit/PR context.
- Prefer conventional commits.
- Keep commits logically focused.
- Never commit secrets or generated local credentials.
- Do not push, open/merge/close PRs, force-push, delete remote branches, or create releases unless explicitly asked.
- CI configuration must not use Docker or service containers.
- GitHub Actions should use supported setup actions and external/preconfigured MySQL when DB integration is required.
